  "resolution_html": "<p>To add or remove users to or from a shared mailbox, the owner must submit a request to add/remove users to <a href=\"mailto:askit@yorku.ca\">askit@yorku.ca</a>. The request must include the Passport York username of each user being added/removed</p>\n<p>If you already have requested access a shared mailbox, you can view it by following the <a href=\"http://yuoffice.yorku.ca/accessing-outlook/#squelch-taas-tab-content-0-4\">steps listed here&gt;&gt; </a></p>",
